StackDiff includes code adapted from or inspired by the following projects:

- OpenAI guided-diffusion: https://github.com/openai/guided-diffusion
- DDNM / SVD-DDNM implementations and related diffusion inverse-problem code.
- Optional baseline comparisons in the paper use external projects including
  PGDGAN and DCGAN-tensorflow. Their source trees are not vendored in this
  release; see docs/baselines.md for reproduction notes and upstream links.

STEM simulation tools such as incostem/computem are external dependencies and
are not distributed as part of this repository. See docs/data_examples.md and
generate_sample documentation for setup notes.
